== Usage ==
A '''Bachelor's Rose''' can be given to any [[NPC]] that can visit the [[The Garden#Visitor|Garden]] to invite them. Up to {{Green|5}} '''Bachelor's Roses''' can be used per day. The same [[NPC]] also can't receive multiple '''Bachelor's Roses''' per day. This resets at midnight [[w:UTC|UTC]].

A '''Bachelor's Rose''' cannot be used on {{Rarity|m|nolink=true}} rarity [[Visitors]] or {{NPCSprite|Beth}}. A '''Bachelor's Rose''' cannot be used on [[Mayor_Election#Mayors_and_Ministers| ministers]].

Upon giving a rose to an NPC, the following message appears in chat:
{{Dialogue|&7&o[NPC] accepts your rose and is delighted to visit your Garden soon.}}

When attemping to give a rose to an ineligible NPC, the following message appears in chat:
{{Dialogue|&cSorry, but this person is not eligible for a rose.}}

When attemping to give a rose to an NPC the player does not meet the requirements for, the following message appears in chat:
{{Dialogue|&cYou do not meet the requirements to give a rose to this person.}}

